Since the class is so simple, it is given in its entirety in a header file. The include guards
become essential in this case and strange things can occur if they are not present.
As a test, the Optim class was used with the simple function f (θ) = − θ (1 − θ) that has a
global minimum of −. 25 at θ min = . 5. The minimization process was then managed by the
following driver program.

